/张（模型已加载）。其他复杂姿势及双人姿势未覆盖，不保证完全复现。\n本工作流使用Pose Gallery图库选图，不需要VNCCS Pose Studio的3D编辑节点。\n输出output/images/qwen2.1/pose_gallery/results/与poses/。\n详见example_workflows/qwen21_pose_gallery.md。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# Pose Gallery + Qwen Image 2.1\n\n先将example_workflows/assets/pose_gallery_person_reference.png复制到ComfyUI/input/，或在Load Image选择自己的参考图。\n图一：Pose Gallery原图；图二：人物参考图。\n通用提示词迁移图一姿态，保留图二身份、服装与画风；切换图库姿势即可，无需固定动作描述。\nQwen Image 2.1 BF16；Pose Studio QI2.1 v2 LoRA强度1；25步、CFG1、Euler/simple、种子20261029。模型路径需与本机一致。\n2026-10-29本地实测：P002站姿与P031跪姿，均使用同一通用提示词，输出896×1184；约17秒/张（模型已加载）。其他复杂姿势及双人姿势未覆盖，不保证完全复现。\n本工作流使用Pose Gallery图库选图，不需要VNCCS Pose Studio的3D编辑节点。\n输出output/images/qwen2.1/pose_gallery/results/与poses/。\n详见example_workflows/qwen21_pose_gallery.md。"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":5,"type":"LoraLoaderModelOnly","pos":[470,1000],"size":[440,220],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":17},{"localized_name":"LoRA名称","name":"lora_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"lora_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"模型强度","name":"strength_model","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"strength_model"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[18]}],"title":"Load LoRA - 加载Qwen2.1姿态编辑适配器","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.43.0","Node name for S&R":"LoraLoaderModelOnly","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"8.0","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["qwen2.1/动作编辑VNCCS_QI2_PoseStudioV2_3294845.safetensors",1],"widgets_values_named":{"lora_name":"qwen2.1/动作编辑VNCCS_QI2_PoseStudioV2_3294845.safetensors","strength_model":1}},{"id":101,"type":"LoadImage","pos":[-32.231418996308825,-639.8853137510077],"size":[440,420],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"选择文件上传","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"uploa